---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import TopNav from '../components/TopNav.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Privacy — Taxline"
  description="How Taxline collects, uses, and protects your data. We do not train models on your client data, and a human approves before any output ships."
>
  <TopNav />
  <main id="main">
    <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 py-20 sm:px-6">
      <p class="ds-eyebrow">Legal</p>
      <h1 class="ds-h1 mt-3">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="mt-2 font-mono text-xs text-fg-faint">Last updated: May 30, 2026</p>

      <h2 class="mt-10 text-xl font-semibold text-fg">Overview</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-fg-muted leading-relaxed">
        Taxline is an AI tax-operations platform. A fleet of specialized agents triages, extracts,
        researches, and assembles tax work into reviewer-ready output, and a human approves before
        anything ships. To do that, the platform handles sensitive financial and personal
        information. This policy explains what we collect, how we use it, and the controls you have.
        It applies to the Taxline application and this website.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-10 text-xl font-semibold text-fg">Information we collect</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-fg-muted leading-relaxed">
        We collect only what the service needs to function.
      </p>
      <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5 text-fg-muted">
        <li>
          <span class="font-medium text-fg">Account information.</span> Your name, work email,
          organization, role, and authentication details when you create or are invited to an account.
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="font-medium text-fg">Uploaded tax documents and financial data.</span> The
          returns, forms, statements, schedules, and client records you or your team submit for
          processing, along with the structured data the fleet extracts from them.
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="font-medium text-fg">Usage data.</span> Logs, device and browser metadata,
          and product interactions we use to operate, secure, and improve the service.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="mt-10 text-xl font-semibold text-fg">How we use information</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-fg-muted leading-relaxed">
        We use your information to provide and operate the service: to run intake, extraction,
        research, and workpaper assembly; to attach confidence scores and citations to each field;
        to route work for human review; and to maintain security, support, and billing.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-3 text-fg-muted leading-relaxed">
        <span class="font-medium text-fg">We do not train models on your client data.</span> Your
        uploaded documents and the data derived from them are used to produce your output, not to
        train, fine-tune, or improve any machine-learning model — ours or a third party's.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-10 text-xl font-semibold text-fg">Data handling and security</h2>
      <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5 text-fg-muted">
        <li>
          <span class="font-medium text-fg">Encryption.</span> Data is encrypted in transit and at rest.
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="font-medium text-fg">Access controls.</span> Access is scoped by role and
          least privilege, with authentication and audit logging on sensitive actions.
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="font-medium text-fg">Retention.</span> We retain your data for as long as
          your account is active or as needed to provide the service and meet legal obligations.
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="font-medium text-fg">Deletion.</span> You can request deletion of your data,
          and we will delete it subject to any retention we are legally required to keep.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="mt-10 text-xl font-semibold text-fg">Subprocessors</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-fg-muted leading-relaxed">
        Taxline relies on a small set of infrastructure and model providers to deliver the service —
        for example, hosting, storage, and the model and embedding providers that power the agents.
        These subprocessors process data only under contract, only to perform services for Taxline,
        and not to train their own models on your data. We require confidentiality and security terms
        consistent with this policy.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-10 text-xl font-semibold text-fg">Your rights</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-fg-muted leading-relaxed">
        Depending on your location, you may have rights over your personal information. In most cases
        you can:
      </p>
      <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5 text-fg-muted">
        <li><span class="font-medium text-fg">Access</span> the information we hold about you.</li>
        <li><span class="font-medium text-fg">Export</span> your data in a portable format.</li>
        <li><span class="font-medium text-fg">Delete</span> your data, subject to legal retention requirements.</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="mt-3 text-fg-muted leading-relaxed">
        To exercise these rights, contact us at the address below. If you use Taxline through your
        firm or employer, some requests may be directed to them as the controller of the data.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-10 text-xl font-semibold text-fg">Cookies and analytics</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-fg-muted leading-relaxed">
        We use a small number of cookies and similar technologies to keep you signed in, remember
        preferences, and understand aggregate product usage. We do not sell your personal
        information. You can control cookies through your browser settings, though disabling some may
        affect how the service works.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-10 text-xl font-semibold text-fg">Children's privacy</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-fg-muted leading-relaxed">
        Taxline is a business tool intended for adults. It is not directed to children under 13, and
        we do not knowingly collect personal information from them. If you believe a child has
        provided us information, contact us and we will delete it.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-10 text-xl font-semibold text-fg">Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-fg-muted leading-relaxed">
        We may update this policy as the service evolves or the law changes. When we make material
        changes, we will update the date above and, where appropriate, notify you. Continued use of
        Taxline after an update means you accept the revised policy.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-10 text-xl font-semibold text-fg">Contact</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-fg-muted leading-relaxed">
        Questions about this policy or your data? Email us at
        <a href="mailto:privacy@taxline.example" class="text-accent transition-colors hover:text-accent-hover">privacy@taxline.example</a>.
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Base>
